( * \050OSF/Motif\051 will create scroll bars which the user can interact with. Whenever a) 81 228.98 T
( * portion of the window needs to be redrawn, the GenView object will invalidate) 81 217.98 T
( * a portion of the window, causing a MSG_META_EXPOSED to be sent to the) 81 206.98 T
( * application. The application will draw the document into the window. The) 81 195.98 T
( * window keeps track of a mask which is used to clip the application\325s) 81 184.98 T
( * drawing operations so only the invalid portion of the window is drawn. */) 81 173.98 T
