(/***********************************************************************) 81 484.98 T
( * MSG_META_EXPOSED for HelloProcessClass) 81 473.98 T
( ***********************************************************************) 81 462.98 T
( * SYNOPSIS:) 81 451.98 T
(Redraw the recently-exposed portion of the View) 168.98 451.98 T
( * PARAMETERS:) 81 440.98 T
(void \050WindowHandle win\051) 168.98 440.98 T
( * SIDE EFFECTS:) 81 429.98 T
(The invalid region of the window is cleared out) 168.98 429.98 T
( *) 81 418.98 T
( * STRATEGY:) 81 407.98 T
(This message is sent by the windowing system when a) 168.98 407.98 T
( *) 81 396.98 T
(portion of the GenView has become invalid, either) 168.98 396.98 T
( *) 81 385.98 T
(because a window that was obscuring it has been moved,) 168.98 385.98 T
( *) 81 374.98 T
(or because some called GrInvalRect.) 168.98 374.98 T
( *) 81 363.98 T
( *) 81 352.98 T
(We redraw the entire document, after telling the) 168.98 352.98 T
( *) 81 341.98 T
(graphics system we\325re drawing to the invalid portion) 168.98 341.98 T
( *) 81 330.98 T
(of the window.) 168.98 330.98 T
( *) 81 319.98 T
(***********************************************************************/) 86.4 308.98 T
(/* The method is declared with the goc keyword @method. This is followed by) 81 290.98 T
( * the name of the class that knows how to handle the message \050in this case,) 81 279.98 T
( * the class is HelloProcessClass\051. Finally, the name of the message that) 81 268.98 T
( * invokes this method is specified. Other items may also be specified \050such) 81 257.98 T
( * as a routine name that can be used instead of a message\051, but these are not) 81 246.98 T
( * required. */) 81 235.98 T
(@method HelloProcessClass, MSG_META_EXPOSED {) 81 224.98 T
(/* The local variable gstate will hold a GState handle. We will do) 102.6 206.98 T
(* our drawing to this gstate. */) 108 195.98 T
(GStateHandle gstate;) 102.6 184.98 T
