(MSG_VIS_DRAW for TicTacBoardClass) 168.98 533 T
( *) 81 522 T
( * DESCRIPTION:) 81 511 T
(This method draws the board\325s outline and the) 168.98 511 T
( *) 81 500 T
(lines of the playing field. It is sent each time) 168.98 500 T
( *) 81 489 T
(a portion of the view window becomes invalid \050such) 168.98 489 T
( *) 81 478 T
(as when the primary is moved\051.) 168.98 478 T
( * PARAMETERS:) 81 467 T
( *) 81 456 T
(void \050word drawFlags, GStateHandle gstate\051) 125 456 T
( *) 81 445 T
(gstate is the handle of the graphics state associated) 168.98 445 T
( *) 81 434 T
(with the exposed portion of the view window) 168.98 434 T
