( * to make sure the gstate does not stay in memory and) 125 231 T
( * begin to slow down the system as more and more) 125 220 T
( * temporary gstates are created but not destroyed.) 125 209 T
(*/) 400.4 209 T
(GrDestroyState\050gstate\051;) 102.6 191 T
