(Many operating systems provide the ability to carry out multiple tasks at) 189 401.33 T
(the same time. While each operating system has its own unique way of) 189 388.33 T
(managing this, there are two fundamental types of multitasking:) 189 375.33 T
-0.03 (cooperative \050used by Microsoft W) 189 362.33 P
-0.03 (indows\051, and preemptive \050used by) 341.08 362.33 P
3 9 Q
